      {
        "category": "Sensitive",
        "description": "Empathy is a psi-ability that makes the psychic aware of, or feel, the emotions of other people, animals and supernatural creatures. The strongest emotions are easiest to sense: hate, anger, terror, love. Feeling for emotions can often be used to establish that somebody or something is nearby, but can NOT be used to pinpoint an invisible or hiding person/ creature. Empathy can be especially helpful in recognizing and communicating with ghosts and other supernatural creatures.",
        "id": "empathy",
        "name": "Empathy",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "metadata-0",
            "name": "Range",
            "source": {
              "book": "Rifts Ultimate Edition",
              "section": "Psionic Powers: Empathy"
            },
            "text": "100-foot area."
          },
          {
            "id": "metadata-1",
            "name": "Duration",
            "source": {
              "book": "Rifts Ultimate Edition",
              "section": "Psionic Powers: Empathy"
            },
            "text": "2 minutes per level."
          },
          {
            "id": "metadata-2",
