        "description": "Hold an object to seek impressions and images of its history and last owner; roll separately for each. Each psychic may read a given object only once, even after failure. A successful impression or image permits a present-time glimpse for an additional 4 ISP, with its own success check. Reading a possessed object exposes the psychic to psychic attacks without saving bonuses.",
